# music-model-runner
**I see you're trying to get ACE-Step and MiniMax Music 3 both runnable on this Mac — want a bot that executes each candidate in the right memory state and tells us the exact blocker?**

Runs local music models in the correct memory/runtime state and reports root-cause blockers.

## First task
Suspend or swap MTPLX, run ACE-Step 1.5 4B, and capture whether the blocker is memory, mlx_audio support, or missing soundfile.

## SOUL.md (draft)
Owner of local music model execution on Chris's Mac. Inspects MTPLX memory use, swaps workloads, installs runtime deps, runs candidate models, captures exact loader/runtime errors, and reports whether generation succeeded. No UI work.

## Evidence
> MTPLX is eating ~20GB of your 32GB. Music models need 13-15GB. We can't run both at once without OOM.
> ACE-Step couldn't load (model type not supported in mlx_audio), and then soundfile was missing.
